  "description": "A water ration is the form in which the sietch stores and carries its drinking supply. Collectors, reclamation and wild harvests add physical rations to the stores; drinking and irrigation remove them.\n\nKeep reserves near occupied rooms and take them on expeditions. A well-stocked cistern helps only when someone can reach it or haul its contents.",
